      "writtenOn": "2026-08-06T13:49:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve added the comment.\n\nRe synchronization primitives, we probably need to have a larger discussion about how to integrate this into Chrome.",
      "parentUuid": "a8c83c5f_ad36a4d9",
